OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow City Council approves plan
OL,4,Ato cut pay for some workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 2,500 staff at Glasgow City
OL,7,FCouncil are to have their wages cut
OL,8,Fafter the local authority approved
OL,9,Fplans to end a long-running equal pay
OL,10,Fdispute.
OL,12,FThe council estimates that 63% of about
OL,13,F24,000 non-teaching staff will get a
OL,14,Fsalary increase under a new pay scheme.
OL,16,FHowever, about 11% of those workers
OL,17,Fcould lose out on up to #11,500 a year.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
