OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow City Council approves plan
OL,4,Ato cut pay for some workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral hundred workers - including
OL,7,Frepresentatives from all three big
OL,8,Fcouncil unions - protested outside the
OL,9,FCity Chambers as councillors agreed the
OL,10,Fplans.
